Type: project
Title: Documentation Environment for the Collapse Output Extension
Description: Declares the R packages the documentation website needs, so
    renv resolves them from this file rather than by scanning the sources,
    which for a documentation site would pick up whatever a code sample
    happens to mention. This is not an R package: `Type: project` is what
    tells renv so, and keeps it from writing an .Rbuildignore.
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
